，店門口外的菜單，並不是所有魚類品項都會每日提供，點餐機旁邊會張貼當日漁獲。\n\n這次點了厚切叉燒拉麵和涼拌日蔬（龍鬚菜）。拉麵吃起來是比較台式口味的，湯頭油度和鹹度都有調整過，所以味道比較淡，不過也因此是可以喝完整碗豚骨湯的。厚切叉燒我個人蠻愛的，吃起來沒有腥味，厚切的口感紮實、也有炙烤過，香氣十足。\n拉麵的麵體是細麵，麵本身我是覺得普普，配料有半顆溏心蛋、筍乾和豆芽菜，其中豆芽菜偏生，好處是口感很脆；壞處就是吃起來有生味。\n整體來說，湯頭、叉燒和溏心蛋是拉麵我比較喜歡的部分。\n涼拌龍鬚菜不錯，是胡麻醬+柴魚片，有點兒偏貴就是了。\n\n內用有兩區座位，前面是吧台座位區，後面有適合多一點人的桌子型座位，這點算是還蠻周到的。\n內用先在店門口排隊，外場人員會出來安排點餐和入座。\n目前僅收現金。",null,[0,97]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16337692464976978993/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwY1dSck9YUmtibTh6VjFjeE5WSlZjRWRXYkRsc1VsaHJNV015WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1927,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0cWRrOXRkbm8zV1cxNVJVcEdWbDlsUlhrMWMyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xabf13355e868ac8c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOktqdk9tdno3WW15RUpGVl9lRXk1c2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0cWRrOXRkbm8zV1cxNVJVcEdWbDlsUlhrMWMyYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjl